  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/895334913560178698/1118530263329288362/wiki.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7BSqZa9r3P\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/895334913560178698/915683102192468018/JoinDiscord.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/895334913560178698/915683907649822750/reportissue.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/t4Ybtys2?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/t4Ybtys2?logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_709964_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Downloads\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/709964.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Versions\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>簡介</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>輕量級 API，供其他模組使用以新增新的六角恐龍變體，同時保持彼此相容性</li>\n<li>本身不會額外新增任何變體</li>\n<li>提供為模組化的六角恐龍變體新增自訂水桶物品模型的可能性</li>\n</ul>\n<h1><strong>內建功能</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>為六角恐龍水桶新增工具提示，顯示其<strong>年齡</strong>、<strong>變體</strong>與來自的<strong>模組</strong></li>\n<li>將所有原版變體的六角恐龍水桶物品材質更換為對應變體材質（材質由 <a href=\"https://github.com/NewSrVraxx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VRAXX</a> 製作）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>推薦模組</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>More Axolotl (Fabric) - DomiIRL</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-axolotl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://u.svrt.dev/u/watery-abandoned-antarcticfurseal.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-axolotl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y5TW2Ou.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>More Axolotl Variants Mod (Fabric &amp; Forge) - AkashiiKun69</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/master/img/new_variants.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>通用資訊</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>召喚指令</strong></h2>\n<p>現在可以使用字串值作為「Variant」NBT 來召喚六角恐龍。</p>\n<p>這類似於 Minecraft 在其他地方廣泛使用的命名空間系統，但該系統並未涵蓋部分實體變體（包含六角恐龍）。</p>\n<p>例如，召喚原版 Lucy 變體的方式如下：</p>\n<pre><code>/summon minecraft:axolotl ~ ~ ~ {Variant:\"minecraft:lucy\"}</code></pre>\n<p>或是召喚 More Axolotl 模組中的變體：</p>\n<pre><code>/summon minecraft:axolotl ~ ~ ~ {Variant:\"more-axolotl:neon\"}</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>給模組開發者的資訊</strong></h1>\n<p>關於使用此 API 進行模組開發的詳細資訊，請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
